    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">### Wishlist Progress</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">11680 / 15000 [\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2588\u2591\u2591\u2591\u2591] 78%</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2111430/extras/6b0b4f5c1e8f79532fe5a20e066f5753.avif?t=1754946547\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>With the approval of the  Pompasaur &gt;&gt;&gt; Inspired by Gnarled hag</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Inspired by Gnarled Hag and Granny. You play as a girl who needs to escape from an old dilapidated house where a scary old man lives.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Hide from him</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2111430/extras/83bf91a951970cf784a1295fba28d00b.poster.avif?t=1754946547\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2111430/extras/83bf91a951970cf784a1295fba28d00b.webm?t=1754946547\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2111430/extras/83bf91a951970cf784a1295fba28d00b.mp4?t=1754946547\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hide behind boxes, crates, a sofa, look for a way out, but most importantly, don't make noise. Otherwise, he will notice you. You don't want him to catch you, do you?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Run from him</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2111430/extras/247e9f732c4dc17cb5e626faf7a5d374.poster.avif?t=1754946547\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2111430/extras/247e9f732c4dc17cb5e626faf7a5d374.webm?t=1754946547\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2111430/extras/247e9f732c4dc17cb5e626faf7a5d374.mp4?t=1754946547\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can still escape if you have enough strength.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Solve riddles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2111430/extras/11895f670e0c968e51c9e852bf6e29de.poster.avif?t=1754946547\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2111430/extras/11895f670e0c968e51c9e852bf6e29de.webm?t=1754946547\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2111430/extras/11895f670e0c968e51c9e852bf6e29de.mp4?t=1754946547\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A big house, many traps and riddles that need to be solved to find a way out of the house.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Plot</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2111430/extras/28092be2fb5d759306b5a4ef2eb7b045.poster.avif?t=1754946547\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2111430/extras/28092be2fb5d759306b5a4ef2eb7b045.webm?t=1754946547\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2111430/extras/28092be2fb5d759306b5a4ef2eb7b045.mp4?t=1754946547\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Yes, you will have to solve it yourself.</p>",
